1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,503
Give a project a time budget. Then connect
the plan to actual work.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,674
In Edit project, set a time budget and a
deadline.

3
00:00:08,933 --> 00:00:12,018
The overview shows recorded time and what is
left.

4
00:00:13,133 --> 00:00:15,121
Add one piece of work as an action.

5
00:00:15,367 --> 00:00:19,028
Choose a subcategory, an owner, planned
dates and an estimate.

6
00:00:20,167 --> 00:00:22,808
Choose the project and matching subcategory.

7
00:00:23,067 --> 00:00:26,374
Select the action, describe the work and
save the entry.

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,824
Use project planning with a team or on your
own computer.
